&lt;div class=&quot;layout-styles__content--2Kv6p&quot; data-ui=&quot;careers-page-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zenoti is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;bilingual Implementation Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt;) to support our customers in successfully adopting and optimising our software platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;product expert and trusted advisor&lt;/strong&gt;, you will guide businesses through every step of the implementation process—from technical setup to training—ensuring a seamless and impactful experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand client needs and design tailored solutions using Zenoti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product demos, training sessions, and solution reviews with a strong business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize the platform according to each client’s specific workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate risks and ensure smooth project rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide high-level technical support and troubleshoot customer issues efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with internal teams to improve product features and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with new Zenoti features and industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, ensuring compliance with SLAs and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 to 8 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in enterprise software implementation and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge in &lt;strong&gt;APIs, cloud solutions, and data migration&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience deploying software at scale and working with enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and client training skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work across distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt; for knowledge of HTML, JavaScript, JIRA, or experience in the wellness/spa industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Zenoti?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a &lt;strong&gt;fast-growing, innovative company&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy &lt;strong&gt;attractive salary and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your career in an &lt;strong&gt;international environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a &lt;strong&gt;diverse, dynamic, and passionate team&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to be part of Zenoti’s journey?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply now and join us in transforming the wellness industry with cutting-edge technology and meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Zenoti provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7729956.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; border-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 6.3826in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 6.3826in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;TW Pricing Operation, Coupang s looking for a Operations Program Manager who is motivated, has a bias for action and can think systemically to bring to life new areas of business for the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;This role will lead a team of junior FTE and operators to work closely with various cross-functional teams to build, launch and scale new needle-moving initiatives that bring direct impact to Coupang price sharpness and the best shopping experience for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;This role requires an individual with excellent attention to detail, a knack for operational process planning, analytical capabilities, innovation, and strong business acumen. An individual would succeed in the role when he/she is a strategic thinker, yet not afraid to roll up their sleeves and getting their hands dirty to ensure front-line executional excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Essential Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Create market research processes and frameworks to analyze data and help Coupang teams understand consumer experiences and make pricing decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze operational data to identify issues and propose both short-term and long-term solutions to enhance the execution and efficiency of market research processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Work with junior FTE and operators for daily operation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze primary and secondary data from multiple data sources related to specific products, delivery conditions, sales channels, and market prices to assist in daily pricing decisions and recommend changes to pricing policies for retail products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with partner teams (accounting, operations, product management, catalog, consumer experience, purchasing, and inventory) throughout various stages of the market research process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in operational roles, incl. 3+ years with responsibility for the set-up of operational processes, oversight over process execution, delivery of improvement programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Strong focus on accuracy and detail in operational processes and market research, with demonstrated ability to collaborate with multiple teams to deliver results within time constraints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in conducting hands-on deep dives into issues, identifying root causes, and proposing practical solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to synthesize information quickly, extract key insights, and present insights to senior manager- and director-level stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #494949;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in data analysis tools (e.g., Excel, Google Sheets) to provide insights, drive changes in operational processes and measure impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7737216.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did I ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being a leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been at since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial, surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compliance plays a critical role in ensuring Coupang operates ethically, transparently, and in full alignment with applicable laws, regulations, and internal policies. As a Compliance Director/Senior Principal, you will lead and manage compliance programs across multiple domains, ensuring they are effectively embedded into the organization and executed with rigor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a strategic partner to business and functional leaders, driving compliance program governance, risk management, and remediation efforts while operating in a fast-paced, rapidly evolving global environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and manage compliance programs across key domains including Health &amp;amp; Safety, Fire Safety, Fair Trade, HR, Product &amp;amp; Trade, Environment, Last Mile Logistics, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, AML/Sanctions, Data Privacy, Ethics &amp;amp; Anti-Corruption, and Financial Crime&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Manage 1 to 3 assigned compliance domains based on expertise, with global coverage across compliance projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive program governance by establishing timelines, tracking progress, and ensuring delivery of key compliance priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain centralized risk tracking systems to monitor compliance gaps and remediation progress&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure timely identification, escalation, and resolution of non-compliance issues across the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with compliance domain leaders and cross-functional stakeholders to ensure program effectiveness and alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and communicate reports, dashboards, and metrics on compliance program performance, including risk status, legal registers, monitoring activities, and compliance priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with senior leadership to drive remediation efforts and strengthen compliance controls&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives to enhance compliance frameworks, processes, and organizational awareness&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Promote a strong compliance culture by embedding policies, standards, and expectations across the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Law, Business, Finance or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years of experience in compliance, risk management, or related areas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities under tight deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in compliance program management and risk assessment methodologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to evaluate complex risks and develop practical solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work independently in a fast-paced and ambiguous environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Broad knowledge across multiple compliance domains&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing compliance programs in e-commerce, technology, or logistics environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global or regional compliance program management experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong influencing skills and ability to partner with senior leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced degree or professional certifications (e.g., CAMS, CIPP, CPA, JD)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organizational and program management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process and Others&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;br&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details to Consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job titles and responsibilities may be subject to change depending on the candidate’s overall experience, etc. This will be communicated to the candidate at the appropriate time before the offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring may be restricted in case the legal qualifications required for hiring and work performance is not met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time regular position and includes 12 weeks of probation period; provided, however, the probationary period may be either skipped, shortened or extended if necessary for business purposes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice is located below.&lt;br&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7849625.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;회사 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 이커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 이커머스 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 유지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;본 포지션은 Coupang 임직원을 위한&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft 365 및 기타 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션 운영을 담당하는 UCC 팀&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;소속입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;협업 플랫폼과 클라우드 기반 서비스 운영뿐만 아니라,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft 365 환경 전반의 데이터 거버넌스 및 보존(Retention) 체계를 주도&lt;/strong&gt;하는 역할을 수행합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;해당 역할은 데이터 수명주기 관리, 레코드 관리, 보존 정책 및 컨트롤, 스크립팅 및 자동화, 그리고 Legal·Security·Compliance·비즈니스 조직과의 협업을 통한 거버넌스 이니셔티브를 지원합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;운영 안정성, 거버넌스 전문성, 지속적인 개선 역량의 균형이 요구되며,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;자동화 및 AI 기반 생산성 도구를 활용하여 운영 효율성, 리포팅 품질, 지식 관리, 서비스 활용도를 향상&lt;/strong&gt;시키는 것이 핵심입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;주요 업무 (Key Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT 및 비즈니스 팀과 협업하여 기술적·업무적 이슈 해결&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PowerShell, Power Automate 등 스크립트 및 자동화 도구 활용&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;다양한 심각도의 프로덕션 이슈 트러블슈팅 및 SLA 기준 가용성 유지&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SLA에 따른 인시던트 대응 및 해결 절차(SOP) 문서화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로덕션 배포, 장애 수정, 릴리즈 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;시스템 인시던트 및 문제를 사전에 식별·진단·조치&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;애플리케이션, 하드웨어, 소프트웨어 변경 관련 계획 수립 참여&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;변경 사항에 대한 사전·사후 리뷰 참여&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;트러블슈팅, 버그 수정, 테스트 및 운영 배포 수행 및 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서비스 요청 큐 관리 및 비즈니스/제품 지원 요청 처리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT 팀 및 벤더와 긴밀히 협업하여 아키텍처 및 설계 이해, 시스템 개선을 위한 변경 요청 제안&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;기술 이슈를 문서화·커뮤니케이션·에스컬레이션하고 비즈니스 영향 설명&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;정책, 절차, 표준 운영 문서(SOP) 준수 및 신규/개정&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft 365 전반에 대한 보존 정책 및 보존 레이블 설계·구현·운영&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;법적·규제·비즈니스 요구사항을 충족하기 위한 데이터 수명주기 및 레코드 관리 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal, Security, Compliance 및 비즈니스 이해관계자와 협업하여 데이터 거버넌스 기준 정의 및 운영&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;거버넌스 문서, 파일 플랜, 예외 처리, 처분 검토, 감사 대응 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;협업 플랫폼 전반의 정책 적용 범위, 거버넌스 상태, 운영 리스크 모니터링 및 개선 추진&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;스크립팅, 자동화, 분석, AI 기반 워크플로우를 통한 거버넌스 운영 개선 기회 발굴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI 기반 도구를 활용하여 리포팅, 지식 베이스 생성, 운영 문서화, 이슈 트렌드 분석 및 지원 효율성 향상&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M365 환경에서 AI 기능을 안전하고 거버넌스에 맞게 도입·운영하여 정보 과다 공유(Oversharing) 리스크를 최소화하고 컴플라이언스 요구사항에 부합하도록 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격 요건 (Basic Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;복잡한 엔터프라이즈 환경에서 협업 플랫폼 운영 및 거버넌스를 리드한 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비즈니스, Legal, Security, IT 팀과의 강력한 파트너십을 기반으로 협업 서비스 오너십 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4년 이상의 프로그래밍/스크립팅 경험 (Java, SQL, JavaScript, PowerShell, Python 등)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Purview 실무 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Data Lifecycle Management, Records Management, Retention Policy/Label 포함)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exchange Online, SharePoint Online, OneDrive, Teams 등 M365 워크로드 전반의 데이터 거버넌스 및 컴플라이언스 이해&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;법적·컴플라이언스·비즈니스 보존 요구사항을 기술적 컨트롤과 운영 프로세스로 전환한 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;엔터프라이즈 SaaS 환경에서 거버넌스 모니터링, 감사/컴플라이언스 지원, 정책 롤아웃 및 예외 처리 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI 또는 AI 기반 생산성 도구를 활용하여 운영 프로세스, 리포팅, 문서화, 지원 효율성, 서비스 활용도를 개선한 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;보안, 데이터 거버넌스, 프라이버시, 정확성을 고려하여 AI 도구를 책임감 있게 적용할 수 있는 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL 프로세스에 대한 기본적인 이해 및 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API 연동 지원 경험 (Microsoft Graph API 등)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;온콜(On-call) 로테이션 포함, 필요 시 비근무 시간 대응 가능&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;높은 기술 이해도와 지속적인 학습 및 개선에 대한 의지&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;복잡한 개념을 명확하게 전달할 수 있는 커뮤니케이션 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;뛰어난 구두·서면·프레젠테이션 커뮤니케이션 및 관계 구축 능력&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;창의적인 문제 해결 능력 및 기존 방식에 얽매이지 않는 솔루션 설계 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;다수의 프로젝트를 동시에 관리할 수 있는 능력&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고객 중심 사고 및 빠른 실행력&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;우수한 문서화 능력 및 모든 고객 상호작용 기록 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;반복 발생 이슈를 식별하고 근본적 해결을 위해 적절히 에스컬레이션할 수 있는 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대 사항 (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;컴퓨터공학 또는 관련 전공 학사 학위, 혹은 이에 준하는 실무 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft 365 Copilot 준비, 도입, 활용, 리포팅 또는 거버넌스 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;보안 및 컴플라이언스를 고려한 AI 기반 업무 생산성 도구 운영 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI 서비스의 Oversharing 리스크 관리, 데이터 접근 거버넌스, 감사 로그, 사용 분석 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;eDiscovery, 레코드 선언, 처분 검토 또는 엔터프라이즈 레코드 관리 프레임워크 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;거버넌스 또는 AI 도입 관련 사용자 교육 및 변화 관리(Change Management) 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Workspace 관리자 운영 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;한국어 및 영어 가능자&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;===&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;전형 절차 및 안내 사항&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;전형 절차&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;서류전형 - 전화면접 - 대면(화상)면접 – 최종 합격&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;참고 사항&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;서류 반환 정책&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;본&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;』&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7916505.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;我們在台灣的包括「火箭速配」，以實惠的價格為多種精選商品提供隔日到貨服務。「火箭跨境」供應來自韓國、美國等地數百萬種暢銷商品，並提供國際速配服務。&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;我們正在尋覓人才協助我們帶領 Coupang 台灣拓展業務。這是個難得的機會，一同參與 Coupang 在台灣的成長，打造一個讓我們的顧客自問「沒有 Coupang，我該怎麼過活？」的世界。  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;職位: 一線客服副理Customer Service Assistant Manager (TW Counie Operations)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;我們正在尋找具備領導力與服務精神的你，帶領客服團隊創造卓越的顧客體驗！ 這個職位不僅需要管理團隊，更需要在第一線與同仁並肩作戰，協助解決客戶的各類問題。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;1. 直接管理與 support 第一線客服專員 (約10-15位客服)&lt;br&gt;2. 管理團隊出缺勤與現場工作狀況&lt;br&gt;3. 即時協助專員處理客戶問題與提供判斷或升級&lt;br&gt;3. 處理 supervisor call-back 與較困難的客戶互動&lt;br&gt;4. 指導客服專員改善應對方式、政策理解與服務品質&lt;br&gt;5. 主動觀察團隊成員狀態、風險與情緒變化&lt;br&gt;6. 必要時向上 escalation 營運或客戶風險&lt;br&gt;7. 協助訓練後的新人 onboarding 與日常團隊穩定&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;1. 對一線團隊穩定性具備高度 ownership&lt;br&gt;2. 對人與團隊狀態具備敏感度&lt;br&gt;3. 能快速判斷現場狀況並做出合理應對&lt;br&gt;4. 在高壓環境下保持冷靜與專業&lt;br&gt;5. 在維持營運規範的同時，時刻重視 customer experience&lt;br&gt;6. 建立團隊信任感與日常 support culture&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;7. 須配合輪班&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;*輪班方式與時間：&lt;br&gt;週一至週日，比照8周變形工時方式排班&lt;br&gt;可選擇固定日班 ：7:00-16:00/14:00-23:00之間輪班(雙北地區需進辦公室)&lt;br&gt;或選擇固定夜班 ：22:00-7:00，夜班可全遠端工作&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;1. 曾擔任資深客服/客服組長，或具其他服務業一線人員管理／輔導經驗&lt;br&gt;2. 具良好溝通能力與問題處理能力&lt;br&gt;3, 能獨立處理客戶 escalation 情境&lt;br&gt;4. 基本英文能力加分&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process and Others &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;申請資格審核 – 電話面試 – 視訊面試 – 錄取通知 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;招聘流程的確切性質可能會根據具體工作而有所不同，並且可能會因日程安排或其他情況而發生變化 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;面試時間表和結果將透過電子郵件地址通知應徵人員&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Details to Consider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;30&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;如果空缺職位已填補，則此職位發布可能會在規定的申請結束日期之前關閉。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;30&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;如果發現候選人在申請過程中提交了虛假信息，Coupang 有權撤銷聘用邀請。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;30&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang 不歧視殘疾申請人或退伍軍人。 我們很自豪能為所有申請人提供平等的機會。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;31&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
