&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is seeking a Senior Product Marketing Manager that will drive the market success of the FlashBlade family, positioning Everpure as the definitive leader in Unstructured Data Storage. By crafting high-impact messaging and collaborating with Product Management and Sales, you will translate technical innovation into compelling business value. Your mission is to accelerate global adoption of the Everpure Platform and Enterprise Data Cloud through world-class technical storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Messaging and Positioning: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the core narrative for FlashBlade, ensuring a consistent, differentiated value proposition that directly increases win rates and market share against competitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-visibility product launches and GTM initiatives, aligning cross-functional teams to drive global pipeline growth and brand awareness for the FlashBlade portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Content Creation: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop a suite of high-conversion marketing assets—including whitepapers, presentations, and web copy—that empower the sales team to shorten deal cycles and land enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Influence and Advocacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a primary spokesperson and subject matter expert, influencing the product roadmap through deep customer insights while representing Everpure at major industry events and analyst briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Experience in Product Marketing: &lt;/strong&gt;A history of successfully owning, launching, and marketing technology products, preferably to Enterprise IT customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;Mastery in translating technical product features into compelling, value-driven stories that resonate with both technical buyers and C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Infrastructure Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understanding of enterprise storage architectures, specifically unstructured (Object and File) data, with the ability to quickly master and articulate new technology trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Messaging, Positioning, and Content Creation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of the written and spoken word, with the ability to create persuasive content and deliver compelling presentations to diverse global audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of leading successful product launches by building strong relationships and influencing stakeholders across Product Management, Sales, and Corporate Communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the &lt;strong&gt;RTP, North Carolina &lt;/strong&gt;office in compliance with Everpure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
