&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in instructional design, enablement content, or learning experience design&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Experience building SCORM-based courses and working within LMS platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Strong graphic design and content creation skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Experience with video production and editing tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Proven ability to create scalable, high-quality learning experiences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
