&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Engagement &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with strategic and existing Backup-only partners.&lt;/li&gt;
